Native callbacks now pair original event frames with original press lifetimes.
This is NOT live routing, admission, queue ordering, activation, popup grants,
keyboard recovery, accessibility, manual hiding or desktop runtime acceptance.
Overflow keyboard isolation remains fail-closed. Release witnesses are retired;
repeat and duplicate press callbacks cannot grant fresh press freshness.
